{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍向往那种不必拼命的生活，正因舍不得它，才不能只待在安宁里旁观，得出去争取。\",\n      \"key\": \"离开安宁\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他发现眼前的行动也在替那种生活争取，珍惜它的愿望和承担责任的心也能一起推着他往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"一起推着\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想留住的不只是自己的安宁，还有故土和共同记忆，所以这份向往也不只属于他自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"共同记忆\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不必因为肩上有责任，就厌倦自己真正想珍惜的生活，也不必为这份依恋羞愧。\",\n      \"key\": \"依恋羞愧\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"旧愿近了些，他又尝到最初相信它时的快乐，却因经历过怀疑和疲惫，知道这份快乐并非理所当然。\",\n      \"key\": \"并非理所当然\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"愿望未成，并没抹掉这份快乐，可他想起现实未变，心里的满足不能代替真正过上那种生活，便清醒过来。\",\n      \"key\": \"现实未变\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他发现旧愿和眼前行动能一起推着他，却仍可能彼此冲突，因为争取未必能按他所愿保护一切。\",\n      \"key\": \"彼此冲突\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"他愿为那种生活吃苦，却知道再多付出也未必更靠近它，不能只因心愿就认定每分付出都值得。\",\n      \"key\": \"每分付出\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"text\": \"他得留心别在争取时耗尽所爱，真要付代价时，仍可能累得想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"耗尽所爱\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-10\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍不知道最后能保住多少珍贵的东西，所以不敢把这场争取当成必有结果。\",\n      \"key\": \"保住多少\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-11\",\n      \"text\": \"他这一刻能做的已经做完，不必再靠不停争取证明心意，暂时歇下来也不等于放弃。\",\n      \"key\": \"歇下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-12\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再反复找理由证明自己该往前，因为清楚知道那种生活正是自己想要的。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己想要\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"src\": [\"S13-6\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0e304581-178e-4f41-b2ac-9dc869d206ec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T180939558799Z", "elapsed_seconds": 328.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T18:15:07.651871+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a1028589e9f4a6fba8cf64891d4868381ec2e8bdf6bfc19438e1d47e0097d102", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T180939558799Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2295ae06c09c44a5744b0dabdeee812f5f7605a0682bfce5f242503747f7c03a"}}}
